 "notes": "Old model lists turned into issue archetypes (originators first) with plates, perforations, watermarks and printings as versions from retrieved pages; issues without a retrieved page stay in m. SG/Scott/Michel numbers only where a page gave them (Scott 389, 834); no catalogue page retrieved, so most numbers are left to the dt axis. Zeppelin issues and the Columbian Issue sit under Commemorative stamp; Inverted Jenny under Stamp error and variety. Silver Jubilee (only the India 1935 set in the data) kept as a model; no page retrieved for a cross-Empire Silver Jubilee archetype. Perforation, watermark, shade, plate, coil/sheet/block are types."
